i7b|n|The act or process of resolving the constituent parts of a compound body or substance into its elementary parts; separation into constituent part; analysis; the decay or dissolution consequent on the removal or alteration of some of the ingredients of a compound; disintegration; as, the decomposition of wood, rocks, etc. ; The state of being reduced into original elements. ; Repeated composition; a combination of compounds.	n:26m9,72,3~26m9,72,3
